    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Your House on an Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an extraordinary journey as you play the protagonist traveling in a house built on a train. Collect resources, upgrade and remodel your train and home, tackle a variety of obstacles, and explore a world shaped by the downfall of a once-glorious train country. Search for your ancestors and uncover the truths of history in this captivating post-apocalyptic landscape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locomotives: Drive and upgrade an array of steam locomotives, featuring models inspired by real-world designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Homes: Expand your house, modify its architectural style, furnish the interior, and create your unique train home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/b0e08a0b0f98d183602e5a54f8671a3b.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/b0e08a0b0f98d183602e5a54f8671a3b.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/b0e08a0b0f98d183602e5a54f8671a3b.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Activities: Immerse yourself in mining, logging, farming, cooking, weaving, crafting, and research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/985ec614aad9000341979cfae139f3d0.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/985ec614aad9000341979cfae139f3d0.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/985ec614aad9000341979cfae139f3d0.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand Your Functionality: Unlock additional capabilities by adding trailers to your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/00b00278f01bd3ff7cec2044b09f7e81.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/00b00278f01bd3ff7cec2044b09f7e81.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/00b00278f01bd3ff7cec2044b09f7e81.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Freely: Navigate a non-linear railroad system and discover new regions at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/87424d2611afa8a350aff08fde915eb1.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/87424d2611afa8a350aff08fde915eb1.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/87424d2611afa8a350aff08fde915eb1.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with Settlements: Trade with residents, complete quests, and hunt for hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/fea045e171344844855cd3eb809251d8.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/fea045e171344844855cd3eb809251d8.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/fea045e171344844855cd3eb809251d8.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Views: Enjoy breathtaking landscapes and expertly crafted camera views for a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to set off on a remarkable journey?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Your House on an Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an extraordinary journey as you play the protagonist traveling in a house built on a train. Collect resources, upgrade and remodel your train and home, tackle a variety of obstacles, and explore a world shaped by the downfall of a once-glorious train country. Search for your ancestors and uncover the truths of history in this captivating post-apocalyptic landscape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e30809f8d70003231476833a7a96bf2a.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Locomotives: Drive and upgrade an array of steam locomotives, featuring models inspired by real-world designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.poster.avif?t=1731640169\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.webm?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326700/extras/e1c9addb9d8cdeddc03246d318f6f2ff.mp4?t=1731640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr